{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# Electro Pipeline 架構圖\n\n完整方塊說明見同資料夾 `Electronic_Pipeline.md`。\npipeline 有結構性改動（新增/移除階段、新增生產預設開啟的機制）時同步更新此圖。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 520,
      "label": "初始化來源（擇一）"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Random init**\n\n`ELECTRO_JACOBI_MODE=off`\n\n隨機初始座標",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**Jacobi 暖啟動**\n（生產預設 replace）\n\nb2b 連線圖做\n20 輪鄰居平均",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "**Spectral / GiFt**\n（opt-in\n`ELECTRO_SPECTRAL=1`）\n\nanchored quadratic\nplacement，一步求解",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## Stage 1\n**analytical_place()**\n\nAdam 梯度下降：\nov / bb / wl /\ngrp(0.4) / mib_shape(0.05)",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## Stage 2\n**legalize()**\n\n1. 順序抽取\n2. 貪婪 或 LP 壓實\n   （LP 生產預設已開）\n3. `_cleanup()` 保底\n   （PUSH_GAP=1e-4）",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## Stage 3\n**soft_repair()**\n\nboundary snap\n+ wide-swap（預設開）\n\ngrouping\npush-past（預設開）",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "**place-compact**（生產預設開，`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`）\n\n把這一輪結果的中心點當新初始化，\n再跑一輪短版 analytical_place → 額外候選\n\n本季最大單一突破：2.1230 → 1.9666",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-030",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "label": "困難案例才加開的候選（opt-in）"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**adaptive spectral**\n`ELECTRO_SPECTRAL_ADAPTIVE=1`\n\n只有 proxy 判斷困難\n（best_600_score ≥ 門檻，\n預設 1.5）才加跑",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**escalated adaptive-seed**\n`ELECTRO_ADAPTIVE_SEED=N`\n\n給難案例再加 N 個\n額外 jacobi seed",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "最佳已驗證組合：adaptive-spectral + escalated(SEED=3)\n+ 池無關 proxy = **1.7279**（約 2× runtime，opt-in，非預設）",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "**Proxy Cost 排名**\n\n預設：候選池平均正規化\n\nopt-in 池無關：\n`ELECTRO_PROXY_ABSAREA`\n`ELECTRO_PROXY_ABSHPWL`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-050",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Portfolio 選擇\n\n每個候選都算一次 proxy cost，**逐案挑最低者送出**\n——不是調出單一最佳參數，是同時養一群候選",
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
